    "id": "backfillComment1",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "5b0c7e1f2a9d4c31",
    "name": "Backfill past days via msg.startDate / msg.endDate (YYYY-MM-DD)",
    "info": "The regular inject fetches today. The two backfill injects set msg.startDate / msg.endDate to fetch past days, e.g. after a database outage. Without msg.endDate, data is fetched until today.\n\nDays are requested one at a time, so past days have the same resolution as the regular data. Data that is already in InfluxDB is overwritten, not duplicated.",
